    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Property Shop are delighted to bring number 41 Aberdeen Street to the Dublin 7 market.  Situated just off Infirmary Road at the gates to Phoenix Park this enclave of Artisan homes is truly a hidden gem within the city. Behind its traditional red brick facade lies a home of charm and boasts many original features, within easy walking distance of both Stoneybatter and Smithfield villages with their independent shops, cafes, bars and restaurants and the City Centre itself also nearby is the Museum at Collins Barracks, Dublin Zoo, Grangegorman Campus and the Central Criminal Courts. \r\nThe accommodation consists of an entrance hallway leading to a spacious living room, a kitchen extension and full bathroom to the rear complete the accommodation on the ground floor. The first floor has two double bedrooms, there is a North facing yard to the rear and on street parking to the front.  Great transport links via Dublin Bus Cross City service, the LUAS and Dublin Bikes all add to the appeal of this location.  There is a great vibrant community spirit in this well established and peaceful residential area which is a rare find so close to the city. This property is a must see and will be of interest to first time buyers. Viewing is by appointment only through our Manor Street office.\r\n\r\n\r\nHallway 1.3m (4'3\") x 1m (3'3\")\r\n\r\nLiving Room/Dining/Kitchen 5.6m (18'4\") x 4m (13'1\")\r\nWith ceiling coving, open fire with marble surround, understair storage, fully open plan living area with kitchen, eye & floor level units, plumbed for laundry.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.08m (6'10\") x 1.06m (3'6\")\r\nFull bathroom with tiled floor & surround, bath with shower, WC and WHB.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 4m (13'1\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\r\nLocated to the front a double bedroom with laminate wood flooring, built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 2.2m (7'3\") x 3m (9'10\")\r\nDouble bedroom to the rear with laminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nExterior 4.4m (14'5\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\r\nLarge Northwest facing yard to the rear, on street parking available to the front.\r\n\r\nArea \r\nApprox 54 Sq M / 581 Sq Ft"
      },
